      "text": "How We’re Getting Ready for Higher Inflation and Food Shortages\n\nInflation keeps rising, and food supply issues are on the horizon — there's no time to waste. We’re sharing our real plan and key goals for this year to stay ahead.\n\n• Building up animal feed reserves 2:02  \n• Expanding crops to feed our animals naturally 2:32  \n• Focusing on perennial crops for long-term harvests 3:23  \n• Freeze-drying a large portion of our produce and some meats 4:41  \n• Taking stock of what food we already have 6:17  \n• Figuring out what we’ll need for a full year’s supply 6:23  \n• Purchasing and storing foods we can’t grow ourselves 7:22  \n• Stocking up on must-have essentials—medicines, soap, herbs, and more 8:30  \n\nHit subscribe and spread the word &gt;&gt; S E E | Secret History\n\nWhispers of the Unknown",
